部分個人電腦製造轉移回中國"},{"title":"HP (NYSE:HPQ) Stock Forecast & Analyst Predictions","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE5IZHY5SmFreG9yaDlGZkdXSS1uSVlSbmR5T2hnSVJlSVpNanpnS0VDSDZ1MUo5TTk4a2ZuNHY4SjlsQlZPaXhzSkFWTFJ3WDdrajhONy1tSTktcTc0ZzlRRHNmMFVQZw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"惠普（NYSE：HPQ）股票預測和分析師預測"},{"title":"HP, Asus shift PC making to China; Dell evaluates move","src":"scanx.trade","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNWV90enlNZEpTTWNTc3FuN1RXbVNGT2JvU2FRbEZKUElsSUFpSU9Wa0tYVXBlLU1HRXlIX1REZEVXN2pRcHdUOWRmdHVkVGtTVmYybzVVQ1JHWFZ0V3dUWWRrWjRQUF92NnBFeE96QloydWl2cTNPRm84T1R0VW1fMG9SYU13V1lPZUxHck05VlNib2JxOElIVmZuRDB5ZGF5WXhEVEpMVmV0NklNZm5kLTlQTWc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"惠普、華碩將個人電腦製造轉移到中國；戴爾評估此舉"},{"title":"‘Works like a beast’: $3k off ‘perfect’ laptop","src":"News.com.au","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"「像野獸一樣工作」：「完美」筆記型電腦可節省 3000 美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"關稅/貿易","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-12-10","period":"2025-10-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/47217/000004721725000071/hpq-20251031.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"HP is a global technology leader and creator of solutions that enable people to bring their ideas to life and connect to the things that matter most. Operating in more than 170 countries, HP delivers innovative and sustainable devices, services and subscriptions for personal computing, printing, 3D printing, hybrid work, gaming and other related technologies.","zh":"惠普是全球技術領導者和解決方案創造者，幫助人們將想法變為現實，並連接到最重要的事物。惠普在 170 多個國家/地區開展業務，為個人計算、列印、3D 列印、混合工作、遊戲和其他相關技術提供創新且可持續的設備、服務和訂閱。"},{"en":"We believe artificial intelligence (\"AI\") is playing a critical role in the transformation of how people live and work, and customers are beginning to recognize the benefits in security, speed and cost. Our high-performing product portfolio includes HP's new line of AI PCs and workstations built with the computing power to enable local AI processing for enhanced performance and features as well as intelligent print features incorporated into our home, office and graphics solutions.","zh":"我們相信人工智慧（「AI」）在人們生活和工作方式的轉變中發揮關鍵作用，客戶開始認識到安全、速度和成本方面的好處。我們的高效能產品組合包括惠普全新的人工智慧電腦和工作站系列，其運算能力可實現本地人工智慧處理，從而增強效能和功能，並將智慧列印功能納入我們的家庭、辦公室和圖形解決方案中。"},{"en":"Our broad range of security capabilities are designed to protect an increasingly distributed user base through security enhanced PCs and printers, hardware-enforced endpoint security software (for both HP and non-HP PCs), and endpoint security services. Our security solutions provide layered resiliency using enhanced features such as containment and isolation technology as well as the use of AI deep-learning to identify and remove malware threats.","zh":"我們廣泛的安全功能旨在透過安全增強型 PC 和印表機、硬體強制端點安全軟體（適用於 HP 和非 HP PC）以及端點安全服務來保護日益分散的用戶群。我們的安全解決方案使用遏制和隔離技術等增強功能以及使用人工智慧深度學習來識別和消除惡意軟體威脅，從而提供分層彈性。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We encounter strong competition in all areas of our business activity. We compete on the basis of technology, innovation, performance, price, quality, reliability, brand, reputation, distribution, range of products and services, ease of use of our products, account relationships, customer training, service, support and solutions including subscription-based offerings and financing, security, availability of application software, and our sustainable impact.","zh":"我們在業務活動的所有領域都面臨激烈的競爭。我們的競爭基礎是技術、創新、性能、價格、品質、可靠性、品牌、聲譽、分銷、產品和服務範圍、產品的易用性、客戶關係、客戶培訓、服務、支援和解決方案，包括基於訂閱的產品和融資、安全性、應用軟體的可用性以及我們的永續影響。"},{"en":"The markets for each of our key business segments are characterized by strong competition among major corporations with long-established positions and a large number of new and rapidly growing firms. Most product life cycles are short, and to remain competitive we must develop new products and services, periodically enhance our existing products and services and compete effectively based on the factors listed above. In addition, we compete with many of our current and potential partners, including OEMs that design, manufacture and often market their products under their own brand names. Our successful management of these competitive partner relationships will be critical to our future success. Moreover, we anticipate that we will have to continue to adjust prices on many of our products and services to stay competitive.","zh":"我們每個關鍵業務領域的市場特徵是，擁有長期地位的大公司和大量新的、快速發展的公司之間競爭激烈。大多數產品生命週期都很短，為了保持競爭力，我們必須開發新產品和服務，定期增強現有產品和服務，並根據上述因素進行有效競爭。此外，我們還與許多現有和潛在的合作夥伴競爭，包括設計、製造並經常以自己的品牌銷售產品的原始設備製造商。我們對這些競爭性合作關係的成功管理對於我們未來的成功至關重要。此外，我們預計我們將不得不繼續調整許多產品和服務的價格以保持競爭力。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-10-31","items":[{"name":"Personal Systems","val":38532000000,"zh":"個人系統"},{"name":"Printing","val":16702000000,"zh":"印刷"}],"total":55295000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-10-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":52002000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":3293000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":55295000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-10-31","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":36083000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"Americas","val":23545000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":19212000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":18596000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":13154000000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":55295000000}},"peers":["IBM","DELL","HPE","CSCO","ORCL"]}}